      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "<br>\n\nThis dashboard shows EMS events **Harvest collected while running**, within the time range selected at the top right (default: last 24 hours). Only the events listed in the [EMS collector template](https://netapp.github.io/harvest/latest/configure-ems/) are collected, and events that occurred before Harvest started polling a cluster are not shown.\n\nCounts are distinct events: repeat occurrences of the same event with the same labels count once. Use the **Message** filter to narrow all panels to specific events. Expand the rows below Highlights for details: **Events by Cluster** and **Events by Message** show counts per severity, and **EMS Events** lists one row per event, with a **Status** and a **Details** column showing the fields each event exports. Click a message in the table to open its description in the NetApp syslog translator. See the [EMS alert runbook](https://netapp.github.io/harvest/latest/resources/ems-alert-runbook/) for remediation steps of events that have alert rules.\n\nRequires the [EMS collector](https://netapp.github.io/harvest/latest/configure-ems/) to be enabled for the poller.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "12.3.2",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 3,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Highlights",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Distinct EMS events raised by the selected clusters over the dashboard time range, across the emergency, alert, error, notice and informational severities, so the severity tiles add up to this total. Repeat occurrences of the same event with the same labels count once. Resolutions of bookend events (for example LUN.online resolving LUN.offline) are not counted.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [],
          "noValue": "0",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "transparent",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "locale"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "percentChangeColorMode": "standard",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "showPercentChange": false,
        "text": {},
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "12.3.2",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "exemplar": false,
          "expr": "count(\n      max_over_time(\n        ems_events{cluster=~\"$Cluster\",datacenter=~\"$Datacenter\",message=~\"$Message\",severity=~\"emergency|alert|error|notice|informational\"}[$__range]\n      )\n    ==\n      1\n  )\nor\n  vector(0)",
          "format": "time_series",
          "instant": true,
          "interval": "",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
